&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Sony Interactive Entertainment?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sony Interactive Entertainment isn’t just the Best Place to Play — it’s also the Best Place to Work. Sony Interactive Entertainment (SIE) is the company behind the PlayStation brand. As a subsidiary of Sony Group Corporation, we’re part of a proud legacy of innovation and excellence. SIE is a dynamic technology company, delivering cutting-edge hardware and network services to more than 100 million people and an entertainment leader, home to some of the most beloved and recognizable intellectual properties (IP) in the world. Our role at SIE is to create and nurture the experiences under the PlayStation brand, a name synonymous with entertainment excellence and creativity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Senior Software Quality Engineer – Mobile Applications&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;Would you like to help ensure the quality of world-class mobile applications used by millions of users? Join the team building innovative quality engineering solutions for mobile platforms, where your work directly impacts app performance, stability, and the overall user experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;Sony Interactive Entertainment has a great opportunity within the Quality Engineering organization! We are looking for a motivated and creative &lt;b&gt;Senior Software Quality Engineer (SQE)&lt;/b&gt; to define mobile test strategies, drive end-to-end quality, and leverage automation to improve testing across our iOS mobile application ecosystem.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;As a Senior Software Quality Engineer, you will work closely with engineering teams to define quality strategies, create comprehensive test plans, execute manual and automated testing, and identify opportunities to expand automation. While this role is not focused on day-to-day software development, candidates should have strong automation experience and be comfortable working with automation frameworks, reviewing automated tests, and partnering with SDETs to improve automation coverage and CI/CD validation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Doing&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color:#000000 !important&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;Lead end-to-end mobile application testing efforts, including defining test strategies, writing test plans, identifying test scenarios, and ensuring comprehensive coverage across new and existing features.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color:#000000 !important&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;Review product requirements, UX flows, high-level system designs, and architecture diagrams to design effective testing strategies for iOS applications.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color:#000000 !important&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;Execute manual and automated tests across functional, integration, regression, and end-to-end scenarios using iOS simulators, physical devices, and cloud testing platforms such as Sauce Labs or BrowserStack.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color:#000000 !important&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;Partner with SDETs and development teams to identify automation opportunities and ensure appropriate automation coverage across the mobile application stack.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color:#000000 !important&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;Support triaging application issues by analyzing logs, identifying root causes, validating fixes, and working closely with development teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color:#000000 !important&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;File clear, actionable defects supported by logs, reproduction steps, and failure data, and drive them through resolution.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color:#000000 !important&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;Validate mobile interactions with backend services through API testing and integration testing, including working with mocked dependencies where appropriate.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color:#000000 !important&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;Drive quality improvements by identifying testing gaps, recommending tooling or process enhancements, and improving overall test effectiveness.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color:#000000 !important&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;Review and validate automated test coverage and support integration of automated tests into CI/CD pipelines such as Jenkins and GitHub Actions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color:#000000 !important&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;Collaborate in an agile, distributed environment with engineering, product, architecture, QA, and operations teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color:#000000 !important&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;5+ years of experience in UI, API, and end-to-end testing, with significant hands-on experience testing iOS mobile applications.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color:#000000 !important&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;Strong experience defining test strategies, creating test plans, and executing comprehensive manual and automated testing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color:#000000 !important&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;Experience working with mobile automation frameworks such as Appium and familiarity with Python-based automation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color:#000000 !important&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;Understanding of mobile application release lifecycle, including build pipelines, TestFlight, versioning, and release validation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color:#000000 !important&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;Experience testing on iOS simulators, physical devices, and cloud testing platforms such as Sauce Labs or BrowserStack.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color:#000000 !important&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;Familiarity with automation frameworks and tools such as pytest, WebdriverIO, or Playwright, with the ability to review, troubleshoot, and work alongside automation engineers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color:#000000 !important&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;Basic programming or scripting experience (Python preferred; Java, JavaScript, or C# is a plus) sufficient to understand automation frameworks, troubleshoot failures, and contribute where needed.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color:#000000 !important&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;Experience working with CI/CD pipelines such as Jenkins or GitHub Actions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color:#000000 !important&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;Strong analytical, debugging, and problem-solving skills with a high sense of ownership.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color:#000000 !important&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;Excellent collaboration and communication skills, with experience working across globally distributed teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color:#000000 !important&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;Ability to learn quickly and thrive in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color:#000000 !important&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;Prior experience with PlayStation SDK development.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color:#000000 !important&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;Experience with GitHub Actions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color:#000000 !important&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;Familiarity with PlayStation products and games.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Please note, Sony Interactive Entertainment conducts background checks at the offer stage for all new employees (which may include criminal background checks for some roles) and will need to process personal information to support these checks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Please refer to our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.playstation.com/legal/careers-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;for more information about what personal information we collect, how we use it, who we share it with, and your data protection rights.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Sony is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All persons will receive consideration for employment without regard to gender (including gender identity, gender expression and gender reassignment), race (including colour, nationality, ethnic or national origin), religion or belief, marital or civil partnership status, disability, age, sexual orientation, pregnancy, maternity or parental status, trade union membership or membership in any other legally protected category.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We strive to create an inclusive environment, empower employees and embrace diversity. We encourage everyone to respond.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Sony Interactive Entertainment is a Fair Chance employer and qualified applicants with arrest and conviction records will be considered for employment.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
